WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.049
This pattern finds the latest admission for each
patient For the current patient

00:00:06.299 --> 00:00:11.875
the inner query finds the maximum admission date The
outer admission

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:17.710
row is kept when its date equals that
patient-specific maximum This pattern

00:00:17.723 --> 00:00:24.619
is useful for latest order latest event newest
status or most recent activity If

00:00:24.645 --> 00:00:27.987
two rows share the same maximum date both can be
returned
